====Gender====
Grammatical gender is not a morphosyntactical feature of Kharia, but the language has independent words to identify whether a male or female of a lexical word is intended. E.g. ''kokro siŋkoy'' 'rooster' and ''kitur siŋkoy'' 'hen'.<ref>Peterson (2011:139)</ref>

